{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: added explicit `uniform(0, 100)` priors for `sigma_a` and `sigma_y`. These parameters were already constrained to `[0, 100]`, so the added priors match the implicit bounded-support prior up to a constant and satisfy SafeStan's requirement that every parameter have exactly one built-in prior before use. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> N;
  int<lower=0> n_pair;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=n_pair> pair;
  vector[N] pre_test;
  vector[N] treatment;
  vector[N] y;
}
parameters {
  vector[2] beta;
  vector[n_pair] eta;
  real mu_a;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_a;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_y;
}
transformed parameters {
  vector[N] y_hat;
  vector[n_pair] a;

  a = 100 * mu_a + sigma_a * eta;

  for (i in 1 : N) {
    y_hat[i] = a[pair[i]] + beta[1] * treatment[i] + beta[2] * pre_test[i];
  }
}
model {
  mu_a ~ normal(0, 1);
  beta ~ normal(0, 100);
  eta ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_a ~ uniform(0, 100);
  sigma_y ~ uniform(0, 100);

  y ~ normal(y_hat, sigma_y);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":1,"n_pair":2,"pair":[1],"pre_test":[6.068926881460889],"treatment":[3.640389064137969],"y":[1.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
